{"key":"APBIO-MCQ-014","kind":"mcq","model":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-pro","pass":"solve","ok":true,"object":{"chosen_label":"C","final_answer":"Cell 1 is prokaryotic and Cell 2 is eukaryotic.","working":"Cell 1 is small, has a single circular chromosome in the cytoplasm, 70S ribosomes, no membrane-bound organelles, and a peptidoglycan cell wall. These are prokaryotic traits, typical of bacteria. Cell 2 is larger, has multiple linear chromosomes inside a double-membrane nucleus, 80S ribosomes, mitochondria, and endoplasmic reticulum. These are eukaryotic traits. Thus, the observations directly support Cell 1 as prokaryotic and Cell 2 as eukaryotic. Ribosomes are present in both cell types and are not membrane-bound organelles, so D is incorrect.","defect":""},"usage":{"inputTokens":556,"inputTokenDetails":{"noCacheTokens":300,"cacheReadTokens":256},"outputTokens":383,"outputTokenDetails":{"textTokens":160,"reasoningTokens":223},"totalTokens":939,"raw":{"prompt_tokens":556,"completion_tokens":383,"prompt_cache_hit_tokens":256,"prompt_cache_miss_tokens":300,"total_tokens":939,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":256},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":223}},"reasoningTokens":223,"cachedInputTokens":256},"attempts":1,"mode":"object","ms":4079,"keyed_label":"C"}
{"key":"APBIO-MCQ-014","kind":"mcq","model":"google/gemini-3.5-flash","pass":"solve","ok":true,"object":{"chosen_label":"C","final_answer":"Cell 1 is prokaryotic and Cell 2 is eukaryotic.","working":"Cell 1 exhibits characteristics of a prokaryote (bacterium): small size (2 Ιm), single circular chromosome, 70S ribosomes, lack of membrane-bound organelles, and a peptidoglycan cell wall. Cell 2 exhibits characteristics of a eukaryote: larger size (20 Ιm), linear chromosomes within a double-membrane nucleus, 80S ribosomes, and membrane-bound organelles (mitochondria and endoplasmic reticulum). Therefore, Cell 1 is prokaryotic and Cell 2 is eukaryotic.","defect":""},"usage":{"inputTokens":504,"inputTokenDetails":{"noCacheTokens":504,"cacheReadTokens":0},"outputTokens":570,"outputTokenDetails":{"textTokens":151,"reasoningTokens":419},"totalTokens":1074,"raw":{"thoughtsTokenCount":419,"promptTokenCount":504,"candidatesTokenCount":151,"totalTokenCount":1074,"trafficType":"ON_DEMAND","promptTokensDetails":[{"modality":"TEXT","tokenCount":504}],"candidatesTokensDetails":[{"modality":"TEXT","tokenCount":151}]},"reasoningTokens":419,"cachedInputTokens":0},"attempts":1,"mode":"object","ms":12940,"keyed_label":"C"}
